 - Residual Neural Networks or Similar to be able to argue and analyze the better  Accuracy between all of the Networks. ","topics":[],"score":224641,"global_rank":151898},{"name":"pjn51/Environmental-Modeling","owner":"pjn51","html_url":"https://github.com/pjn51/Environmental-Modeling","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"This is a repo for my models of environmental systems (just for fun really). ","topics":[],"score":224641,"global_rank":151901},{"name":"mathewvarghesemanu/Titanic-dataset","owner":"mathewvarghesemanu","html_url":"https://github.com/mathewvarghesemanu/Titanic-dataset","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Machine Learning challenge on Kaggle","topics":[],"score":224641,"global_rank":151918},{"name":"philipkobernik/voice-mementos","owner":"philipkobernik","html_url":"https://github.com/philipkobernik/voice-mementos","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":224641,"global_rank":151922},{"name":"sadrafh/Nobel_prise","owner":"sadrafh","html_url":"https://github.com/sadrafh/Nobel_prise","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":224641,"global_rank":151932},{"name":"sadrafh/Credit_card","owner":"sadrafh","html_url":"https://github.com/sadrafh/Credit_card","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":224641,"global_rank":151933},{"name":"sadrafh/Discovery_Handwashing","owner":"sadrafh","html_url":"https://github.com/sadrafh/Discovery_Handwashing","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":224641,"global_rank":151934},{"name":"sadrafh/Git_hub_history","owner":"sadrafh","html_url":"https://github.com/sadrafh/Git_hub_history","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":